{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#935","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#935","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#935\",\"parent_revision\":\"2f25a94920fe5b072d2af317a944ac9e946938764a07681df42e1c259cfef4d9\",\"root_revision\":\"2f25a94920fe5b072d2af317a944ac9e946938764a07681df42e1c259cfef4d9\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nCreate the /work-milestone skill for the development-harness plugin. The skill reads a dispatch plan YAML, creates an integration branch, spawns TeamCreate teams with one member per parallel item in each wave, each running /work-backlog-item --auto in an isolated worktree. Manages merge queue with slot serialization, conflict severity classification (trivial/medium/heavy), assign_back on heavy conflicts. Inter-worker awareness via SendMessage, design decisions persisted to GitHub Issues. Discovery relay between waves. Lands integration branch to main when done. Design doc at .claude/reports/milestone-orchestration-design-20260320.md defines the full workflow.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **create /work-milestone skill** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Milestone orchestration design \u2014 .claude/reports/milestone-orchestration-design-20260320.md\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"3afc0e936aa67a378b18e3df00f6ccdb3f21669c36294ea5e6966b01b17cba90\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWYNTg\"}"}